{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painted Legend 2</strong> is an atmospheric platformer crafted in a unique grid notebook style. It continues the story begun in <strong>Painted Legend</strong>, as the player once again steps into a hand-drawn world filled with adventure, danger, and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the north, an ancient evil has awakened - a mysterious necromancer spreads fear and destruction. The wizard Partas and his nephew, the warrior Favian, embark on a distant journey to stop the looming threat. Along the way, new playable characters will be introduced, each with their own abilities and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world where every line and stroke is part of a living narrative. You\u2019ll experience thoughtful platforming, exploration, combat, and a distinctive visual atmosphere where imagination comes to life on grid-lined pages.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d9ec9c27f2e1a8dc6b038ec87710b576838947f9.jpg","localized_name":"Hunting time!","name":"Hunting time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335340/d9ec9c27f2e1a8dc6b038ec87710b576838947f9.jpg"},{"icon":"8213c82f121380018847d5133e68042ddf235044.jpg","localized_name":"It's an honour for me!","name":"It's an honour for me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335340/8213c82f121380018847d5133e68042ddf235044.jpg"},{"icon":"34abbb5cc99c8785eba6f84852eb3d3acc85029f.jpg","localized_name":"It's cold here!","name":"It's cold here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335340/34abbb5cc99c8785eba6f84852eb3d3acc85029f.jpg"},{"icon":"7a6dddcea8fb544787e913395a58bec121bd7748.jpg","localized_name":"Caught it again!","name":"Caught it again!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1335340/7a6dddcea8fb544787e913395a